2026-10-23T21:59:02.9234941Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9235217Z 
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9235309Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9235467Z 
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9235536Z Commands:
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9235838Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9236398Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9237133Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9237799Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9238419Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9239028Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9239618Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9240518Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-23T21:59:02.9241195Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
